The book sent to the device on March 31 was blank, with only "Please look forward to it", and the electronic version of the book on Amazon was reduced to 18 yuan.
3. Repeated attempts to delete the blank book downloaded from the device and to sync again over the two days failed to access the electronic version of The Essence of Business with the actual content, but the book was already available for preview on Amazon.
I have a few thoughts at the moment.
1. The problem of price is not the most important. The key is how to replace the blank books on kindle with books with actual content now. It is not always "please wait" when downloading.
2. The books pre-ordered should not be bought again because it would be very complicated to re-download an empty book if they were cancelled.
3. I hope Amazon provides a normal channel to report such issues; when there is any doubt about downloading or using e-books, one can have an outlet to feedback (e.g., through tickets or online customer service). This can be similar to how Microsoft’s official store handles it.
Lonely little lion
When I got the book, I thought it would be as simple as The Lost Piece of Paper, but turns out there's still a lot of text!
It took three reading sessions to finish the book for the children, a little lion who can shoot, a little lion who loves to eat fruit juice and sweets.
When I saw the scene of the lion eating the hunter, I felt a little uncomfortable, and modern city people can’t accept such an arrangement of being eaten by animals.
In the end, the little lion, who had succeeded in human society, was lost, and he was no longer a complete lion or a complete human.
Finally, only the silhouette of the little lion is left, and I don't know where he went.
Perhaps years later, the image of the little lion will remain in the child &apos; s mind as she grows up, recalled at an unexpected moment one day, and perhaps touched or inspired her.
