This purchase was not very satisfactory.
I bought the baby diapers from Amazon for the second time. I bought a box when my baby was 2 months old. I chose the diapers made of imported paper from Europe. I was quite satisfied with the first purchase experience. My baby used one diaper all night. It is really possible to meet the 12-hour diaper-free requirement.
But this time, I bought L-type diapers, and there were 2 packages in one box. When I opened it, I found that the paper was quite loose, and there was a clear difference with the imported Pampers. After using it for my baby, it was still okay, and there was no urine leakage and no signs of rashes.
But when the second diaper was used, the baby's inner thigh immediately appeared with a rash, which has not faded away until now.
I suspect that the quality of the two packages in one box is not the same.
I will not buy it again in the future!
